Thanks for the report! I found the cause.

**Cause:** When the player presses Y on "Play again? (y/n)", `levelSelected` is set to `false`, but `gameOver` is never reset. Because `gameOver` stays `true`, `frame()` keeps drawing the ending screen, so the menu never appears.

**Fix:** Reset `gameOver` in the Y branch of `handleKeyDown`:

```js
if (event.key.toLowerCase() === "y") {
  levelSelected = false;
  gameOver = false;   // added
  result = "";
  typed = "";
  lives = 3;
  alreadyMissed = false;
  locationKey = "";
}
```

With this change, pressing Y returns the player to the menu (1: Beginner / 2: Pro). I'll open a PR with this fix.
